{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35417","headline":"汉武帝将候西王母下降 · 曹唐","name":"汉武帝将候西王母下降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崑仑凝想最高峰，王母来乘五色龙。\n歌听紫鸾犹缥缈，语来青鸟许从容。\n风回水落三清月，漏苦霜传五夜钟。\n树影悠悠花悄悄，若闻箫管是行踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}